{"repositoryId":564858613,"availability":"available","full":"benisalla/ismail-ben-alla-link-in-bio-2022","name":"ismail-ben-alla-link-in-bio-2022","description":"⚡ Fast, mobile-friendly link-in-bio page with an interactive WebGL 3D tech stack: click a technology and its projects stack up into a 3D house. Three.js + Vite.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2022-11-11T17:07:04Z","updated":"2026-10-17T17:38:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://benisalla.github.io/ismail-ben-alla-link-in-bio-2022/","topics":["3d","bio-link","github-pages","interactive-portfolio","javascript","link-in-bio","linktree-alternative","open-source","personal-website","portfolio","responsive","threejs","vite","webgl"],"demo":"https://benisalla.github.io/ismail-ben-alla-link-in-bio-2022/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:01.299Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:01.299Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:41:01.299Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T22:41:01.299Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fast, mobile-friendly link-in-bio page (a self-hosted Linktree alternative)","with an interactive WebGL 3D tech stack: click a technology and the projects","🌐 Live site · Run it locally · Make it your own"],"features":["Instant on every device. The profile card is plain HTML with inlined CSS, so it paints on the first round trip: the links are visible after only about 28 KB.","3D tech stack (WebGL). 61 technologies float behind the card as a periodic table that morphs into a sphere, helix or grid. Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom.","Hover a tile and it lifts toward you, with a tooltip showing how many projects use it (the number is also on each tile's badge).","Smooth. All tiles are one InstancedMesh (a single draw call, sorted back to front each frame) using one texture atlas, a render loop that sleeps when nothing moves, shaders compiled i